              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ciyosh"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I have made other Mochiko recipes with this rice flour. With this one I did add 4 eggs instead of 2 and had to cook at least 50mins so the center would cook. Came out fine. Much sweeter cause of the extra sugar. A good recipe.",
